      "message": "Match the refusal to the pending Child SA rekey’s message ID. `last_init_msg_id` advances for INFORMATIONAL liveness probes too. If VPP sends a probe between the rekey request and its authenticated TEMPORARY_FAILURE response, the response still matches the pending rekey but this check leaves `sa-\u003erekey` set. The debug ASAN regression test answered the intervening probe, then observed VPP refuse a valid peer rekey with TEMPORARY_FAILURE. Store the outbound message ID in the pending rekey record when sending or retrying, and compare the refusal against that ID before clearing the record.",
