      "message": "Count valid rekey refusals as handled responses. Even when this branch clears the pending exchange, it returns zero and the caller increments `IKEV2_ERROR_MALFORMED_PACKET`. The debug ASAN test observed `malformed_packet` rise from 0 to 1 after a valid authenticated TEMPORARY_FAILURE. Recognize an error Notify and return a handled-without-reply result so the malformed counter remains useful for packet decoding failures.",
